{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "the-naked-director-s01e05-scene-10",
  "pair": "ja-en",
  "title": "君のその目が物語のすべてだ  (Hands, Open Eyes, and Hunting for a Whistle)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "muranishi": "村西",
    "kuroki": "黒木",
    "toshi": "トシ"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Under the warm studio lights, Muranishi gives Kaoru Kuroki just two pieces of acting advice before rolling cameras—while out on the streets, Toshi hunts desperately from shop to shop for a whistle. Listen to Muranishi, Kuroki, and Toshi in Japanese first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "撮影する前に、君に一つアドバイスしておくことがある。手と目の使い方だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "手と目？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "手は女性を美しく表現するのに一番大切なパーツだ。人間の情感は手に出る。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "絶対に手の動きが死なないように意識しろ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "何があっても目だけは閉じるな。今回は台本がないから、君のその目が物語のすべてだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "私の目が？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "この二つだけ守れば、あとは自由に感じたまま自分でやればいい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "はい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "おじさん、ここに笛あるかい？笛！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "ねえのかよ！どこだよ、笛！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "じいさん、ここに笛ねえか？早くしてくれよ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "はあ？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "撮影する前に、君に一つアドバイスしておくことがある。手と目の使い方だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Before we start filming, I have one piece of advice for you: how to use your hands and eyes.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "手と目？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'My hands and my eyes?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "手は女性を美しく表現するのに一番大切なパーツだ。人間の情感は手に出る。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hands are the most vital part for expressing a woman's beauty; human emotion shows in the hands.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "絶対に手の動きが死なないように意識しろ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Stay conscious of your hands so their movement never goes lifeless.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "何があっても目だけは閉じるな。今回は台本がないから、君のその目が物語のすべてだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And whatever happens, never close your eyes — with no script today, your eyes tell the entire story.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "私の目が？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'My eyes tell the story?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "この二つだけ守れば、あとは自由に感じたまま自分でやればいい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Keep just those two rules, and for everything else act freely just as you feel.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "はい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Understood.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "おじさん、ここに笛あるかい？笛！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hey mister, got any whistles in this shop? A whistle!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "ねえのかよ！どこだよ、笛！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You don't carry any?! Where on earth can a guy find a whistle?!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "じいさん、ここに笛ねえか？早くしてくれよ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hey pops, got a whistle in here? Hurry it up, please!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "はあ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wait — what on earth is THIS thing?!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "撮影する前に、君に一つアドバイスしておくことがある。手と目の使い方だ。",
      "gap": 0.5
